  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.11 Contingent reimbursement",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-04-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.11 “Contingent reimbursement” means reimbursement of loan principle if funds become available as specified in RSA 485-H:6, and the term is separate and distinct from “loan forgiveness” as defined in Env-Dw 1402.30.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21, ss by #13289, INTERIM, eff 10-30-21, EXPIRES: 4-28-22; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
